    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let's be real, most games these days are easy. <strong>This isn't that.\u00a0</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BUMBI: a hardcore precision platformer where you fetch bones and try not to die.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore Six Unforgiving Worlds\u00a0</i>\ud83c\udf0b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/aa5528c76bd7d21737682f880e2ca617.poster.avif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/aa5528c76bd7d21737682f880e2ca617.webm?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/aa5528c76bd7d21737682f880e2ca617.mp4?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world introduces punishing trials that will leave you wondering if BUMBI's bone is even worth fetching. From spinning sawblades to slippery slopes, make sure to have your swear jar nearby (you might even be able to go on vacation after finishing this game... if you can).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Precision Platforming in Style\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udca7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/5f94c5399cdaaaa1f0979adc28e7a20c.poster.avif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/5f94c5399cdaaaa1f0979adc28e7a20c.webm?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/5f94c5399cdaaaa1f0979adc28e7a20c.mp4?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are no rules here, either be a wimp and play it safe or break some bones trying to achieve the best score in the world. Each level challenges you to showcase your platforming geniusness by offering multiple ways to beat them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Made with Love\u00a0</i></strong>\ud83e\uddb4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/16ed4b8cacfd57246d0d881f243e8e1f.poster.avif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/16ed4b8cacfd57246d0d881f243e8e1f.webm?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/16ed4b8cacfd57246d0d881f243e8e1f.mp4?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We really wanted to make a game that feels\u00a0<i>ridiculously</i> fun (and enraging) to play. That's why each and every level is carefully handcrafted. BUMBI's animations match it's ridiculous personality and it's controls have undergone many months of development at the expense of our sanity. And every sound in the game? It's made entirely b<i>y mouth! </i>Cause why not.<i> </i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/2024-01-31_10-00-24.gif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 /></span><i>    </i> <br><br><i>*We accept no responsibility for broken keyboards.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Let's be real, most games these days are easy. <strong>This isn't that.\u00a0</strong><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to BUMBI: a hardcore precision platformer where you fetch bones and try not to die.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Explore Six Unforgiving Worlds\u00a0</i>\ud83c\udf0b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/aa5528c76bd7d21737682f880e2ca617.poster.avif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/aa5528c76bd7d21737682f880e2ca617.webm?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/aa5528c76bd7d21737682f880e2ca617.mp4?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world introduces punishing trials that will leave you wondering if BUMBI's bone is even worth fetching. From spinning sawblades to slippery slopes, make sure to have your swear jar nearby (you might even be able to go on vacation after finishing this game... if you can).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Precision Platforming in Style\u00a0</i>\ud83d\udca7</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/5f94c5399cdaaaa1f0979adc28e7a20c.poster.avif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/5f94c5399cdaaaa1f0979adc28e7a20c.webm?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/5f94c5399cdaaaa1f0979adc28e7a20c.mp4?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are no rules here, either be a wimp and play it safe or break some bones trying to achieve the best score in the world. Each level challenges you to showcase your platforming geniusness by offering multiple ways to beat them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Made with Love\u00a0</i></strong>\ud83e\uddb4</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/16ed4b8cacfd57246d0d881f243e8e1f.poster.avif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/16ed4b8cacfd57246d0d881f243e8e1f.webm?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/16ed4b8cacfd57246d0d881f243e8e1f.mp4?t=1755425330\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We really wanted to make a game that feels\u00a0<i>ridiculously</i> fun (and enraging) to play. That's why each and every level is carefully handcrafted. BUMBI's animations match it's ridiculous personality and it's controls have undergone many months of development at the expense of our sanity. And every sound in the game? It's made entirely b<i>y mouth! </i>Cause why not.<i> </i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862470/extras/2024-01-31_10-00-24.gif?t=1755425330\" width=800 height=258 /></span><i>    </i> <br><br><i>*We accept no responsibility for broken keyboards.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Expect no handholding in this diehard, handcrafted precision platformer. You play as BUMBI, a dog with a crippling addiction to bones. Make daring jumps, escape fast-moving obstacles, and above all- try not to die (a lot).",
